    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(5,-3)$",
      "worked": "The centre is the midpoint of the diameter.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Centre}&=\\left(\\frac{2+8}{2},\\frac{1+(-7)}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=(5,-3).\n\\end{aligned}$$",
